# Private, never committed. Written before the first commit: a file committed once survives its
# own deletion.
#   _private/  the harvest and scoring pipelines (software detection, FAIR assessment), the raw
#              ORCID records and per-profile scores, and the curators' platform list. They run
#              on the maintainer's computer; only their aggregated output is published, through
#              scripts/export.mjs, which names every field it lets out.
#   _ref/      notes on how the private parts work.
#   CLAUDE.md  operational notes that describe the private pipelines.
_private/
_ref/
CLAUDE.md

# Copied from data/ at build time (web: npm run sync-data), so it can never go stale.
web/public/data/

# Build and dependencies
node_modules/
web/dist/

# Local tooling and OS noise
.claude/
.env
*.bundle
.DS_Store
